      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 489620,
      "end_ms": 490360,
      "text": "在这种情况"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "start_ms": 490360,
      "end_ms": 494330,
      "text": "如果真的吸你吸你吸的狠狠的把你当牛马的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "start_ms": 494330,
      "end_ms": 496400,
      "text": "不再认为他们是自己人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 135,
      "start_ms": 496400,
      "end_ms": 497930,
      "text": "去寻找你的自己人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 136,
      "start_ms": 497930,
      "end_ms": 499260,
      "text": "组建你的自己人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 137,
      "start_ms": 499320,
      "end_ms": 501810,
      "text": "成为你自己的自己人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 138,
      "start_ms": 501810,
      "end_ms": 504550,
      "text": "这样你看到希望就是着眼点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 139,
      "start_ms": 504550,
      "end_ms": 505330,
      "text": "要看到希望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 140,
      "start_ms": 505330,
      "end_ms": 509450,
      "text": "还有一个着眼点就是要始终要维持个人温饱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 141,
      "start_ms": 509450,
      "end_ms": 511010,
      "text": "在这样的情况之下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 142,
      "start_ms": 511010,
      "end_ms": 514190,
      "text": "你的身段是非常灵巧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 143,
      "start_ms": 514190,
      "end_ms": 518549,
      "text": "但是灵巧就是我只要一人吃饱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 144,
      "start_ms": 518549,
      "end_ms": 519659,
      "text": "全家不愁了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 145,
      "start_ms": 519659,
      "end_ms": 520200,
      "text": "你懂吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 146,
      "start_ms": 520200,
      "end_ms": 521100,
      "text": "灵巧呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 147,
      "start_ms": 521100,
      "end_ms": 525400,
      "text": "我只我可以就打打零工做日结啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 148,
      "start_ms": 525400,
      "end_ms": 527200,
      "text": "但是只要满足我的个人温"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 149,
      "start_ms": 527200,
      "end_ms": 527830,
      "text": "饱就行"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 150,
      "start_ms": 527830,
      "end_ms": 529930,
      "text": "另外一方面你又非常的敏感"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 151,
      "start_ms": 529930,
      "end_ms": 531220,
      "text": "因为你要看到希望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 152,
      "start_ms": 531220,
      "end_ms": 532740,
      "text": "我一定要看到希望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 153,
      "start_ms": 532920,
      "end_ms": 537600,
      "text": "我没有希望便不愿意再继续在这个世界当中存在的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 154,
      "start_ms": 537600,
      "end_ms": 540099,
      "text": "要要有这种坚定的意志"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 155,
      "start_ms": 541260,
      "end_ms": 542600,
      "text": "看不到希望怎么办"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 156,
      "start_ms": 542600,
      "end_ms": 543800,
      "text": "成为这种希望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 157,
      "start_ms": 543800,
      "end_ms": 545030,
      "text": "创造这种希望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 158,
      "start_ms": 545030,
      "end_ms": 546710,
      "text": "让别人看见希望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 159,
      "start_ms": 546710,
      "end_ms": 548579,
      "text": "你就看见了希望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 160,
      "start_ms": 549020,
      "end_ms": 550310,
      "text": "明白了吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 161,
      "start_ms": 550310,
      "end_ms": 552500,
      "text": "你如果能够让别人看见希望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 162,
      "start_ms": 552500,
      "end_ms": 554870,
      "text": "你就成为这种希望了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 163,
      "start_ms": 554870,
      "end_ms": 557339,
      "text": "一夜就看见你也就看见希望了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 164,
      "start_ms": 557840,
      "end_ms": 558680,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 165,
      "start_ms": 559700,
      "end_ms": 562160,
      "text": "就是弄清楚谁是你自己人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 166,
      "start_ms": 562260,
      "end_ms": 565320,
      "text": "谁终究是和你拥有同样的利益"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 167,
      "start_ms": 565320,
      "end_ms": 566220,
      "text": "同样的宿命"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 168,
      "start_ms": 566220,
      "end_ms": 569400,
      "text": "同样的终极存在方式"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 169,
      "start_ms": 572940,
      "end_ms": 575570,
      "text": "你这个现在农村的那些老亲戚"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 170,
      "start_ms": 575570,
      "end_ms": 577580,
      "text": "老子娘或者说伏地魔"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 171,
      "start_ms": 577580,
      "end_ms": 578740,
      "text": "你在那些地"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 172,
      "start_ms": 578760,
      "end_ms": 581430,
      "text": "他们的存在方式可以复制吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 173,
      "start_ms": 581430,
      "end_ms": 583020,
      "text": "你可以再成为他们"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 174,
      "start_ms": 583020,
      "end_ms": 585180,
      "text": "然后再吸引下一代的血吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 175,
      "start_ms": 586240,
      "end_ms": 588510,
      "text": "你觉得这游戏你还玩的成吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 176,
      "start_ms": 588510,
      "end_ms": 589650,
      "text": "完不成的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 177,
      "start_ms": 589650,
      "end_ms": 590940,
      "text": "那就认识到他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 178,
      "start_ms": 590940,
      "end_ms": 593550,
      "text": "你和他们的中立存在方式是不一样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 179,
      "start_ms": 593550,
      "end_ms": 595800,
      "text": "你那些脑子里幻想小孩拉扯大的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 180,
      "start_ms": 595800,
      "end_ms": 596850,
      "text": "赚到工资了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 181,
      "start_ms": 596850,
      "end_ms": 599890,
      "text": "然后就可以供我老年"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 182,
      "start_ms": 599890,
      "end_ms": 600850,
      "text": "就是老了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 183,
      "start_ms": 600850,
      "end_ms": 602410,
      "text": "当然不能叫不劳而获"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 184,
      "start_ms": 602410,
      "end_ms": 604870,
      "text": "就是我就可以安安生生活了吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 185,
      "start_ms": 604870,
      "end_ms": 606490,
      "text": "你可以这样去幻想吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 186,
      "start_ms": 606490,
      "end_ms": 607960,
      "text": "你也能够做到吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 187,
      "start_ms": 607960,
      "end_ms": 608950,
      "text": "做不到呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 188,
      "start_ms": 608950,
      "end_ms": 613150,
      "text": "那你就意味着谁到底跟你的终极存在方式是一样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 189,
      "start_ms": 613150,
      "end_ms": 615220,
      "text": "不得不劳作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 190,
      "start_ms": 615220,
      "end_ms": 615460,
      "text": "甚至"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 191,
      "start_ms": 615460,
      "end_ms": 616900,
      "text": "说老龄化了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 192,
      "start_ms": 616900,
      "end_ms": 618190,
      "text": "不得不终身劳作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 193,
      "start_ms": 618190,
      "end_ms": 619219,
      "text": "不得食"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 194,
      "start_ms": 620880,
      "end_ms": 625580,
      "text": "谁和你的存在方式是骨子里是一模一样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 195,
      "start_ms": 625580,
      "end_ms": 628120,
      "text": "谁才是你归根结底的自己人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 196,
      "start_ms": 628660,
      "end_ms": 635569,
      "text": "还不是你旁边那个流水线上跟你做同样重复劳动的那个家伙"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 197,
      "start_ms": 635569,
      "end_ms": 640420,
      "text": "还不是和你在路边摊上和你一样饥肠辘辘的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 198,
      "start_ms": 640420,
      "end_ms": 642580,
      "text": "只愿意掏几个钢蹦出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 199,
      "start_ms": 642580,
      "end_ms": 643120,
      "text": "扫码"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 200,
      "start_ms": 643120,
      "end_ms": 646060,
      "text": "扫两三块钱出来买一个小吃的那个家伙"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 201,
      "start_ms": 646180,
      "end_ms": 648260,
      "text": "你们一样没有希望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 202,
      "start_ms": 648840,
      "end_ms": 653120,
      "text": "但是只要你们认清楚谁是自己人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 203,
      "start_ms": 653120,
      "end_ms": 658860,
      "text": "你就看到了希望谁和你拥有同样的终极存在方式"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 204,
      "start_ms": 658860,
      "end_ms": 660780,
      "text": "你的死法是一样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 205,
      "start_ms": 660780,
      "end_ms": 662589,
      "text": "人才是自己人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 206,
      "start_ms": 662589,
      "end_ms": 664389,
      "text": "我自己说死法是一样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 207,
      "start_ms": 664389,
      "end_ms": 665889,
      "text": "就是说你要目目测"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 208,
      "start_ms": 665889,
      "end_ms": 667329,
      "text": "如果按照现在这个推断"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 209,
      "start_ms": 667329,
      "end_ms": 669090,
      "text": "那肯定都他妈啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 210,
      "start_ms": 669870,
      "end_ms": 672580,
      "text": "七八十岁不说过劳死吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 211,
      "start_ms": 674800,
      "end_ms": 677680,
      "text": "就在出租屋里面烂成一摊肉泥了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 212,
      "start_ms": 678860,
      "end_ms": 680140,
      "text": "好像目测我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 213,
      "start_ms": 680140,
      "end_ms": 683740,
      "text": "咱们这几集几十上百号人都是这么一个宿命呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 214,
      "start_ms": 683740,
      "end_ms": 684790,
      "text": "那这种情况之下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 215,
      "start_ms": 686890,
      "end_ms": 688780,
      "text": "你好好看看怎么来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 216,
      "start_ms": 688880,
      "end_ms": 690320,
      "text": "就是这一艘船"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 217,
      "start_ms": 690320,
      "end_ms": 691940,
      "text": "他怎么来逃避"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 218,
      "start_ms": 691940,
      "end_ms": 693110,
      "text": "不要触礁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 219,
      "start_ms": 693110,
      "end_ms": 698200,
      "text": "不要陷入这么一个悲惨的恐怖的风浪当中去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 220,
      "start_ms": 705260,
      "end_ms": 707579,
      "text": "那这时候你就获得了你的阶级意识"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 221,
      "start_ms": 708480,
      "end_ms": 711339,
      "text": "所以我说你是灵巧又敏感的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 222,
      "start_ms": 712940,
      "end_ms": 714970,
      "text": "必须轻装上阵"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 223,
      "start_ms": 714970,
      "end_ms": 716780,
      "text": "轻装上阵"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 224,
      "start_ms": 717500,
      "end_ms": 721760,
      "text": "双手才有余力去握紧别人的双手"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 225,
      "start_ms": 721760,
      "end_ms": 723680,
      "text": "握紧自己人的双手"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 226,
      "start_ms": 723680,
      "end_ms": 728780,
      "text": "你说最终为什么我们要保持最大的灵巧和敏感"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 227,
      "start_ms": 728780,
      "end_ms": 735979,
      "text": "他的目的就是要死死的死死的握住自己人的双手"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 228,
      "start_ms": 739880,
      "end_ms": 742720,
      "text": "然后我给你的要求就是说不是握住同一个自己"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 229,
      "start_ms": 742720,
      "end_ms": 746680,
      "text": "人家左两只手各握一个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 230,
      "start_ms": 746680,
      "end_ms": 748240,
      "text": "连接起来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 231,
      "start_ms": 748240,
      "end_ms": 750859,
      "text": "要握不同的自己人的双手"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 232,
      "start_ms": 751040,
      "end_ms": 753560,
      "text": "你有一个音乐的爱好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 233,
      "start_ms": 753560,
      "end_ms": 759130,
      "text": "那你就用这个爱好去和另外一个工人和大连接起来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 234,
      "start_ms": 759130,
      "end_ms": 760600,
      "text": "你有一个下棋的爱好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 235,
      "start_ms": 760600,
      "end_ms": 762820,
      "text": "就用这个爱好和那个工人连接起来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 236,
      "start_ms": 762820,
      "end_ms": 764459,
      "text": "广交朋友"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 237,
      "start_ms": 765280,
      "end_ms": 766440,
      "text": "成为同治"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 238,
      "start_ms": 766440,
      "end_ms": 768180,
      "text": "死死的握住自己的双手"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 239,
      "start_ms": 768180,
      "end_ms": 770790,
      "text": "让你的身段是灵活啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 240,
      "start_ms": 770790,
      "end_ms": 772020,
      "text": "是灵敏的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 241,
      "start_ms": 772020,
      "end_ms": 773560,
      "text": "灵活敏感的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 242,
      "start_ms": 774040,
      "end_ms": 776260,
      "text": "一定要看清楚谁是自己人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 243,
      "start_ms": 776260,
      "end_ms": 778550,
      "text": "那个你越是努力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 244,
      "start_ms": 778550,
      "end_ms": 780380,
      "text": "他的小三小四小五小六"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 245,
      "start_ms": 780380,
      "end_ms": 783700,
      "text": "他的他的这个公寓套间"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 246,
      "start_ms": 783700,
      "end_ms": 787000,
      "text": "别墅越多的那个老板绝不是你自己人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 247,
      "start_ms": 790140,
      "end_ms": 793960,
      "text": "或者比如说你是个厨房的一个呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 248,
      "start_ms": 793960,
      "end_ms": 794680,
      "text": "打下手的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 249,
      "start_ms": 794680,
      "end_ms": 795520,
      "text": "他是大厨"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 250,
      "start_ms": 799360,
      "end_ms": 802450,
      "text": "那你要看到他跟你一起"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 251,
      "start_ms": 802450,
      "end_ms": 803800,
      "text": "他想要忽悠你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 252,
      "start_ms": 803800,
      "end_ms": 806440,
      "text": "跟你一块去骂外卖小哥的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 253,
      "start_ms": 806440,
      "end_ms": 814910,
      "text": "或者跟你忽悠你这个学徒一块去骂外面的吃饭的那个穷人也是穷啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 254,
      "start_ms": 814910,
      "end_ms": 816390,
      "text": "贫穷的工人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 255,
      "start_ms": 816390,
      "end_ms": 819030,
      "text": "留学生工人在来这个餐馆吃饭"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 256,
      "start_ms": 819030,
      "end_ms": 823599,
      "text": "这个大厨要带着你这个小工一块去骂那些人的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 257,
      "start_ms": 823880,
      "end_ms": 828060,
      "text": "你要意识到这是一个这是个老虎"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 258,
      "start_ms": 828060,
      "end_ms": 831000,
      "text": "带着你这批羊去骂骂那些路"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 259,
      "start_ms": 831000,
      "end_ms": 834060,
      "text": "或者说骂那些牛马草食动物"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 260,
      "start_ms": 834780,
      "end_ms": 836300,
      "text": "你不要那么傻呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 261,
      "start_ms": 837920,
      "end_ms": 838460,
      "text": "懂了吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 262,
      "start_ms": 839600,
      "end_ms": 841199,
      "text": "他是老虎啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 263,
      "start_ms": 848320,
      "end_ms": 849550,
      "text": "你明白吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 264,
      "start_ms": 849550,
